# ffmpeg build outputs (Phase 7) - the binary is a build artifact, the script is the source
tools/ffmpeg-build/

# Native binaries are build artifacts, never sources. The Phase 0 probe binary is pulled
# off a device (see app/src/main/jniLibs/README.md); the Phase 7 ffmpeg binary will come
# from tools/build-ffmpeg.sh. Neither belongs in git.
app/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so

